# ─── the real question bank ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lives in a SEPARATE PRIVATE repository. It is deliberately not published:
# the exercises are used for grading, so students must not be able to read the
# answer keys. A small demo module ships in src/content/ so that a plain clone
# of this repository still builds and runs.
content-private/

# The generator of the answer-key export (MEE-intrebari-raspunsuri.md/html). It holds no questions
# itself, but it reads content-private/ and cannot run without it, so it is useless in a public
# clone — and its name alone advertises that a full key export exists. Ignored rather than shipped;
# check-not-staged.mjs flags it too, and a gate that blocks the real push helps nobody.
scripts/make-review.mjs

# ─── dependencies and build output ─────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.tsbuildinfo

